[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0257","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0257.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0597","title":"Zetetic STRIP PalmOS 密码管理弱随机数导致暴力破解漏洞","description":"Zetetic 公司为 PalmOS 开发的密码管理工具 STRIP（Secure Tool for Recalling Important Passwords）0.5 及更早版本存在密码可被暴力破解的安全漏洞。该工具使用 SysRandom 函数生成随机数，而 SysRandom 以 TimeGetTicks（系统滴答计时器）作为种子，导致随机数可预测性极高。同时，其实现缺陷大幅缩减了密码搜索空间，使得本地攻击者能够通过暴力枚举方式在较短时间内恢复所有已存储的密码。该漏洞影响 STRIP 0.5 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高，攻击者需具备本地访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0597"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:36Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 Zetetic STRIP 0.5 及更早版本，改用支持加密安全随机数生成器（CSPRNG）的密码管理工具（如 KeePass、1Password）。如必须继续使用 STRIP，请升级至 0.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复 SysRandom 种子熵不足导致的密码搜索空间大幅缩减问题。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0169.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2567","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6362","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20746","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0597.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0597","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0597.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0597.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-78c3-v436-q543/GHSA-78c3-v436-q543.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0597.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--03d379da-b98d-4af7-be42-117468d53ea3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0257.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0256","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0256.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0596","title":"Netscape Communicator GIF 图片 JavaScript 代码执行漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 4.77 及更早版本存在 GIF 图像 JavaScript 执行漏洞，攻击者可通过在 GIF 图像注释字段中嵌入任意 JavaScript 代码构造恶意图像。当用户使用受影响版本的 Netscape Communicator 查看该图像时，浏览器在解析 GIF 格式过程中未对注释内容进行安全过滤，导致注释中的脚本被自动执行。未经身份认证的远程攻击者利用该漏洞可获取受害者当前页面的 Cookie、会话令牌及浏览历史等敏感信息，进而实施会话劫持或进一步攻击。该漏洞影响范围涵盖所有未部署安全补丁的 Netscape Communicator 4.x 版本，无需用户额外交互即可在正常浏览过程中触发。CVSSv2 评分为 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络远程、攻击复杂度低、无需认证即可完成利用。Debian 及 RedHat 等主流 Linux 发行版均已发布安全公告（DSA-051、RHSA-2001-046）并推送修复补丁，用户应升级至 Netscape Communicator 4.77 或更高版本以彻底消除该风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0596"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:36Z","remediation":"将 Netscape Communicator 升级至 4.77 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。由于 Netscape Communicator 已停止维护，建议迁移至受现代浏览器（如 Firefox、Chrome 或 Edge）。如短期内无法升级或更换浏览器，可暂时禁用 JavaScript 执行，并避免打开来自不可信来源的 GIF 图片作为缓解措施。Debian 用户应安装 DSA-051 安全更新，Red Hat 用户应应用 RHSA-2001-046 补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000393","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-014-01","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98685237415117&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-051","http://www.osvdb.org/5579","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-046.html","http://www.securi