 环境变量缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 7 和 8 系统中 kcsSUNWIOsolf.so 库存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过设置 KCMS_PROFILES 环境变量触发该漏洞，导致任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.5/2.6/7.0/8 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用 kcms_configure 程序传递超长环境变量即可触发溢出，进而以进程权限执行任意代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0595"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:36Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Sun 官方补丁：Solaris 7 安装补丁 108652-xx，Solaris 8 安装补丁 108653-xx（可通过 Oracle 支持门户下载）。如无法安装补丁，可执行 `chmod 0 /usr/openwin/bin/kcms_configure` 移除 setuid root 权限，或卸载 KCMS 软件包 `pkgrm SUNWkcs`。作为临时缓解措施，在系统环境变量中过滤 KCMS_PROFILES 的异常长度输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0203.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2605","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6365","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20768","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0595.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0595","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0595.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0595.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-792f-vcf6-566f/GHSA-792f-vcf6-566f.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/rpc_kcms.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/solaris251_103879.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0595.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0255.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0253","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0253.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0594","title":"Sun Microsystems Solaris 命令行缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 7/8 系统中 kcms_configure 程序存在命令行参数缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 kcms_configure 传递过长的命令行参数触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而覆盖返回地址并执行任意代码，进而获取提升后的本地权限。该漏洞影响 Solaris 7 和 Solaris 8 系统，CVSS 评分 4.6（本地攻击、低复杂度、无需认证、部分机密性/完整性/可用性影响），攻击者需具备本地登录权限，通过构造超长命令行参数触发溢出并执行 Shellcode 实现本地提权。Sun Microsystems 已发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0594"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:35Z","remediation":"建议立即安装最新的Solaris补丁更新包（针对Solaris 7.0和Solaris 8.0，应更新到最新的安全修复包）。如果无法立即完成补丁更新，作为临时缓解措施，可通过修改 `/etc/system` 文件禁用 `kcms`服务，限制对 `kcms_configure`命令的访问权限，并使用组策略确保只有授权系统管理员可以执行此命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0140.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2558","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6359","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A65","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A7","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20741","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0594.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0594","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-059