d":"AVE-2001-0445","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0445.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1055","title":"Microsoft Windows 98 ARP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 98/98SE 网络协议栈存在 ARP 洪水拒绝服务漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可发送大量源 IP 和 MAC 地址随机的畸形 ARP 请求包（如 ARPNuke 工具演示），导致目标系统 CPU 资源耗尽，引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 98 及 98SE 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属网络访问、低复杂度、无需认证、部分可用性影响的拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者仅需网络层访问权限即可发起攻击，无需用户交互。Microsoft 已发布补丁修复该漏洞，建议升级至修复版本或升级操作系统版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1055"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:29Z","remediation":"建议将系统从 Windows 98/98SE 升级至 Windows XP SP3 或更高版本，微软已停止对旧系统的安全支持。若无法立即迁移，应在网络层启用交换机 Port Security 功能绑定合法 MAC 地址，并配置 ARP 速率限制规则以过滤异常 ARP 泛洪数据包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/200323","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3113","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6924","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21040","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1055.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1055","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1055.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1055.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3xpc-4hfv-fv7x/GHSA-3xpc-4hfv-fv7x.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1055.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3113/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799