-06-16T21:55:36Z","remediation":"立即将 SnapStream PVS 升级到 1.3 或更高版本（该版本已修复明文密码存储问题）。如无法升级，手动设置 SSD.ini 文件权限为仅管理员可读（Linux: chmod 600 SSD.ini；Windows: 右键属性→安全→删除 Everyone 和 Users 的读取权限），并确保该文件不在 Web 根目录下。同时将数据库连接方式改为 Windows 集成身份验证，避免在配置文件中存储任何凭据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-07/0606.html","http://discuss.snapstream.com/ubb/Forum1/HTML/000216.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3101","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6917","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21035","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1107.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1107","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c144cc7f0a439e059cbec31e55f668a8db4215cb/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1107.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1107.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cxx9-ppqv-r2xf/GHSA-cxx9-ppqv-r2xf.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1107.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1107.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--89d384e7-387a-4d07-a9d7-05e6c6042ab8.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/NVDFeatureAnalysis/blob/493a57a415cc110f9945148abd717eeb92f6ca7e/originalDataset/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0460.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0440","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0440.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1021","title":"Ipswitch WS_FTP Server 多FTP命令缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Ipswitch WS_FTP Server 2.0/2.02 存在多个 FTP 命令缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过匿名登录后向 DELE、MDTM、MLST、MKD、RMD、RNFR、RNTO、SIZE、STAT、XMKD、XRMD 等 11 个命令传递超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 WS_FTP Server 2.02 及更早版本，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1021"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:25Z","remediation":"立即升级 WS_FTP Server 至 Progress 官方最新支持版本（当前为 WS_FTP Server 8.x），该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。旧版 2.0.2 已停止技术支持，无法通过补丁修复。如无法升级，在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 服务（端口 21）的匿名访问来源 IP，仅允许可信网络段连接，并禁用不必要的 FTP 命令（DELE、RNFR、MKD 等）以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-07/0610.html","http://www.ipswitch.com/Support/WS_FTP-Server/patch-upgrades.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6911","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21036","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2001/CVE-2001-1021.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1021.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1021","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1021.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1021.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q779-8rmm-x7qv/GHSA-q779-8rmm-x7qv.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/wsftp_overflows.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82909/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1021.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0440.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0359","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0359.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1022","title":"GNU groff pic 格式化字符串漏洞","description":"GNU groff 的 pic 预处理工具中存在格式化字符串漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 plot 命令，利用格式化字符串说明符绕过 -S 安全选项，从而执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 groff 1.16.1 及更早版本、jgroff 1.15 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1022"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:25Z","remediation":"升级 groff 至 1.17 及以上版本，或安装对应发行版安全补丁（Debian DSA-072）。如无法升级，避免将 groff/pic 暴露给不可信输入，不在 LPD 打印服务中直接处理用户提交的 plot 文件，并禁用 groff -S 选项的远程调用。对于 jgroff 用户，升级至 1.15 及以上版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000428","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-072","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-107","http://www.osvdb.org/1914","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-004.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/199706","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3103","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6918","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21037","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1022.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1022","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1022.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1022.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-072.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fj6r-7wmg-qvf3/GHSA-fj6r-7wmg-qvf3.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1022.md","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-072.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--41d990f2-69c6-462c-a928-d0fe926d5609.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0359.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0459","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0459.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1106","title":"Sambar Sambar Server 默认密码保护漏洞","description":"Sambar Server 4.x 及 5.0 版本默认配置使用编译在二进制程序中的对称密钥对用户密码进行加密，本地攻击者可通过逆向分析该密钥或修改 Sambar 程序副本调用解密函数，从而破解所有用户密码。该漏洞影响 Sambar Server 5 及更早版本，攻击者获取密码后可进一步访问系统敏感资源，危害较大。官方未发布补丁，建议升级至更高版本或更换其他 Web 服务器软件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1106"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:35Z","remediation":"Sambar Server 已停止维护且不再发布安全更新，建议立即迁移至 Apache HTTP Server、Nginx 或 IIS 等仍在维护的 Web 服务器。如暂时无法迁移，可在 Sambar Server 前部署反向代理（如 Nginx）处理身份认证，并在防火墙层面限制对 Sambar 管理端口的访问来源 IP，同时禁用所有默认账户并改用外部认证机制（如 LDAP）