isco IOS UDP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 12.0 至 12.2.1 版本存在 UDP 拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标路由器或交换机发送大量 UDP 数据包触发该漏洞，导致设备 CPU 资源耗尽、网络服务中断。该漏洞影响 Cisco 多款路由器和交换机，攻击条件简单，仅需网络可达即可实施。Cisco 已发布安全公告建议用户升级至 12.2.2 及以上版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1097"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:34Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco IOS 至 12.2.2 或更高版本以彻底修复此漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在边界路由器上配置 ACL 限制入站 UDP 流量速率（使用 committed access rate 或 control plane policing），并禁用不必要的 UDP 服务（如 echo/chargen）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99749327219189&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/199558","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3096","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6913","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21028","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2001/CVE-2001-1097.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1097.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1097","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1097.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1097.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-37wx-px9v-xhhf/GHSA-37wx-px9v-xhhf.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3096/info.html","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0458.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0435","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0435.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0991","title":"Scott R. Lemmon Proxomitron Naoko-4 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Proxomitron Naoko-4 BetaFour 及更早版本存在跨站脚本漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含恶意脚本的畸形 URL，当 Proxomitron 代理服务器处理该 URL 并返回错误信息时，恶意脚本会被反射回用户浏览器中执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，在受害者浏览器上下文中执行任意脚本代码，可能导致会话劫持、敏感信息窃取等危害。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0991"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:22Z","remediation":"Proxomitron Naoko-4 已停止维护，建议立即替换为 Squid、HAProxy 等活跃维护的代理软件。如暂时无法替换，可在 Proxomitron 配置文件中启用 HTML 编码过滤规则，将错误信息中的 `<`、`>`、`\"` 等特殊字符转义为 HTML 实体，防止脚本在错误页面中执行。同时建议在浏览器端禁用第三方代理的 JavaScript 执行权限作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/198954","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3087","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6887","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21025","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0991.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0991","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/32286684634cb7274b436e1f3bc41f1accc1edc6/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0991.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0991.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g8q9-m36q-5j85/GHSA-g8q9-m36q-5j85.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-0991.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0991.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--72e0f908-3285-4f76-a4b0-125a9cd823d9.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x4000/3087/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0435.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0435.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0435.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0434","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0434.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0989","title":"Debian Pileup 缓冲区溢出本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Pileup 1.2 之前版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 /usr/bin/pileup 程序提供超长的命令行参数或超长的 callsign 参数触发缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者能够获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Debian 2.2 系统，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0989"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-23T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:21Z","remediation":"升级 Pileup 至 1.2 或更高版本以修复缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可移除 /usr/bin/pileup 的 SUID 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/pileup）以消除本地提权风险，或卸载 pileup 软件包（apt-get remove pileup）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-07/0512.html","http://www.babbage.demon.co.uk/linux/pileup-1.2/pileup-1.2.tar.gz","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3086","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/1170","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/200